            <ArticleTitle>Atherosclerosis of the aorta and coronary arteries in five towns. Material and methods.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>489-99</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This chapter outlines the way in which the problems of obtaining and assessing population-related material and analysing the data were tackled. Some of the limits of the approach used, namely, the examination of nearly all deaths from several demographically defined communities, are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
